atlas external

architecture external-estate-density
  canonical_name ExternalEstateDensity
  family external
  domain External / Cross-domain Composition
  layer external/descriptor
  semantic_question Which unrelated worlds can lawfully reuse this source's observed semantic outputs and affordances?
  purpose Compiles the external estate as a cross-domain reagent library. A source is classified by reusable semantic output, affordance, carrier, economics, temporal/spatial scope, actor, world phase and interaction fit, then may enter many Worlds without becoming their semantic owner.
  maturity measured
