  invariant source descriptors remain observed candidates until ForeignTwin, CapabilityClosure, Authority and Evidence admit their respective facts
  invariant one source may contribute to many unrelated Worlds without unifying the subjects, owners or facts in those Worlds
  invariant a URL may narrow an external candidate slice only through observed candidate fields; kind, relation, near, state and time without a corresponding observed field remain explicit unresolved shape rather than a match claim
  invariant actor closure, exact audience, institutional role, authority, financial authority and effect authority are rejected from the public candidate-slice query and remain AddressPlane/native-owner work
  invariant a grammar's SurfaceDemand deterministically ranks candidates from the same source reservoir by declared affordance, domain and carrier diversity; ranking changes presentation order, never candidate truth, admission or identity
  invariant an addressed World may use only an explicit WorldDemand alias to narrow the candidate graph; an alias is a composition declaration, not evidence that two Worlds are identical
  invariant every imported ExternalOccurrence receives a reproducible AddressPlane mask from declared terms, so all 4,891 can be considered without a source read; a survivor remains observed_candidate pending exact owners
  invariant a World may compile formation candidates only from explicitly counted heterogeneous observed signals (material, observation, comparison, schedule, communication, market, identity or place); a formation candidate names source occurrence ids and missing signals, and cannot create a publication, service, institution, market, budget, membership, governance process, transaction, provider standing or effect
  invariant the estate-wide formation catalogue is an unranked census of every declared World and its observed-signal coverage; greater source count or coverage never establishes value, demand, need, legitimacy, priority, eligibility, authority or permission to form
  invariant a formation recipe may name only a declared native operator archetype and ProjectPrimitive facet as a possible human operating grammar; it never names an actual person, role assignment, engagement, membership, budget, commitment, employer, authority or launch
  invariant a World bridge is exact overlap of observed source-candidate membership only; it may name common source occurrences, carriers and affordance signals but never establishes a semantic World relationship, shared audience, spatial relationship, shared need, data-combination right, provider standing, authority or a shared project
  invariant raw external descriptors may be inspected only inside an operator closure; a human surface receives typed material or an application lowered from lawful owner records, never a descriptor, protocol label or ExperienceChain
  forbidden_inference a public source listing -> a callable, paid, authorized, correct or available provider
  forbidden_inference a cross-domain composition -> permission to combine personal, institutional or external data
  invariant an ExperienceMap reference with no exact stage fit emits no stage edge; lexical or category discovery is candidate evidence only and may never fall back to the first prose stage
  invariant market, donor, Frappe and Ghost reference planes are independent evidence inputs; a small market sample may not become a renderer-selection ceiling, and Ghost remains art-direction candidate evidence until separately observed
  invariant every ExperienceProgram owns typed application declarations with explicit material roles, renderer requirements, action families and empty/refusal states; legacy prose stages are compatibility-only and may not create an executable graph edge
  invariant generic machine and discover-only bindings remain visible in the specificity audit and never count as a specific protocol or human experience
  interacts foreign-twin
  interacts provider-graph
  interacts web-address-edge
  witness Aurekai/tests/external-estate-runtime.test.mjs proves the original compiled runtime preserves all 4,891 source occurrences (4,152 non-protocol plus 739 protocol rows), retains raw source provenance, answers World/domain/affordance queries locally without probing a provider, refuses non-HTTP targets before transport, and uses declared grammar demand plus carrier diversity rather than corpus order for a candidate slice
  witness Aurekai/tests/external-estate-runtime.test.mjs proves all 30 declared Worlds compile into one unranked formation census over the full measured candidate estate, with six possible formation grammars kept as observed candidates rather than launches
  witness Aurekai/tests/external-estate-runtime.test.mjs proves every formation recipe's possible operator is present in the generated native operator declaration, while the formation output expressly refuses to invent a person in that role
  witness Aurekai/tests/external-estate-runtime.test.mjs proves School Township's bridge compiler finds a separately addressable Household Daily Life overlap while retaining the no-relationship/no-data-combination boundary
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/external_estate_test.sh proves the native C/SQLite import retains all 4,891 occurrences, joins each exact occurrence to its ExperienceMap human/protocol/stage program, refuses the Cure Cancer With AI weather collision, and lowers script-free inspection fragments
  witness cmd/BonfyreExperienceMap/tests/compile_stage_bindings.test.mjs proves an unmatched candidate and a reference-only app emit no stage edge, a presentation reference does not bind merely by looking like a page, an exact weather affordance binds only the weather stage, and stale output is refused; the full 5,591-record native manifest and digest match the retired Python compiler
  witness cmd/BonfyreExperienceMap/tests/participation_activation.test.mjs proves CUE-routed diagnostic ranking preserves the observed-body and retained-body handoff gates, accepts a causally linked owner braid and rejects scripted step counts; the native manifest first matched the retired Python compiler byte-for-byte, then deliberately replaced source-text readiness claims with receipted bridge evidence
  witness cmd/BonfyreExperienceMap/tests/participation_report.test.mjs proves candidate join power stays separate from measured owner depth, retained-body rungs require present nonempty bytes, repeat observation requires more than one receipt, and unreceipted owner claims are refused; current full-estate native outputs were byte-identical to the retired Python compiler at cutover
  witness cmd/BonfyreExternalEstate/tests/participation_test.sh and cmd/BonfyreFacet/tests/reader_agreement_test.sh prove native estate and facet readers still agree with the Bun participation projection and refuse three unverifiable owner rows without Python in these test paths
  witness cmd/BonfyreExperienceMap/tests/compile_experience_map.test.mjs proves all current human chains have interaction-reference evidence from the 20-market, 19-donor, 9-Frappe and 238-Ghost lattice while references remain evidence-only; it verifies typed application declarations remain unselected and without executable edges. Current full-estate native outputs were byte-identical to all retired Python compiler outputs at cutover, including the manifest digest.
  witness cmd/BonfyreExperienceMap/tests/audit_experience_map.test.mjs checks specific versus generic external bindings and missing ghost/app human chains; tests/vectors/policy_compilation.json holds its runtime descriptor byte-for-byte against CUE; the native audit's current generated-estate JSON was byte-identical to the retired Python audit at cutover
  witness cmd/BonfyreExperienceMap/tests/materiality_report.test.mjs checks that weak generic bindings, missing reagent roles, and stale stage projections remain diagnostic rather than admissions; the native report's current generated-estate JSON was byte-identical to the retired Python report at cutover
  witness cmd/BonfyreScopedRespecialize/tests/scoped_respecialize_test.sh proves a changed FactDelta recomputes only its affected subject/scope closure, preserves an already-present external dependency, dispatches only the newly selected external candidate to MaterialCompiler, and records an idempotent receipt; its argument-boundary witness proves the 4096-closure capacity is heap-owned and prints usage rather than overflowing the carrier stack
  source_lineage AUREKAI_EXTERNAL_ESTATE_MASTER_INDEX_V4 and MACHINE_PROTOCOLS_CONTINUATION_V3
  known_gap ExperienceMap human chains and generated stage bindings are now compatibility/reference artifacts only. SitePrograms need typed application nodes with consumes/produces, renderer requirements, actions and explicit empty/refused states before a public route may execute one.
  invariant the activation projection reports occurrence-keyed bridge evidence and a falsifiable native registration witness; it does not inspect source text for readiness or infer general future handoffs from one receipt
  known_gap FactDelta-driven scoped respecialization can now compute and hand off only-new external candidate material for an already-resolved subject/scope closure. PackGraph and World native owners still need to expose their complete scoped demand closures to the SitePresentation reader before a private or institutional World can contribute that material to a public-facing edition.
  known_gap the JavaScript reservoir service remains a read-only inspection/import lane. The native C/SQLite projection is operator inspection material only; a SitePresentation material compiler and typed application lowerers are still owed before any public route may consume the reservoir.
  known_gap individual source candidates remain unadmitted: each still needs a concrete provider binding, terms/credential review, CapabilityClosure result, applicable InformationPolicy, receipted ForeignTwin observation and native effect gate before it can do work beyond the explicit no-body transport probe.
